                            <cell>Advanced: TF–66, AW–65, Fiddler, Flipper</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Current: F–105, A–5, F–100D, CF–100, F–104D, F–101, F–102, F–3, 8,
                                6, Mirage 111, F–5A</cell>
                            <cell>Current: Fitter, Fishbed (Mig 21), Firebar A, Farmer (Mig 19),
                                Fishpot, Firebar B</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
